":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/04/25/9271761/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、また美味しそうな\nパフェ屋さんを見つけたんです(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい行きたい♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ私の中でのパフェブームは\nガンガン継続中～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パフェ巡りとかなんだか\nすごくアイドルらしい趣味を\n見つけました(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはことりっぷ集めも\nずっと継続してやってたり、\nもにまるずもずっと集めてる♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はすみっコぐらしも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなお店のマカロン巡りも\n何年も続けてたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい飽き性だけど\n好きなものは続くみたいです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"密かにコスプレはどんどん\nいろんな種類が溜まっていってます笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コスプレするのも好きだけど\n小物を集めるのも好きみたい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/04/25/9271761/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のブログは好きなことを\nたくさん書いてみました∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimo